        "title": "The bar chart below shows the proportion of the population aged 65 and over of three countries in 1980 and 2000 and prediction in 2030. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSTNdWZ3aohkVYxRjvOlXSgkgci\"><em><strong>The bar chart below shows the proportion of the population aged 65 and over of three countries in 1980 and 2000 and prediction in 2030. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make a comparison where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Population Aged 65+ in Three Countries: 1980&ndash;2030</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i <em>Population Aged 65+ in Three Countries: 1980&ndash;2030</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số từ 65 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n của ba quốc gia v&agrave;o năm 1980 v&agrave; 2000 v&agrave; dự đo&aacute;n v&agrave;o năm 2030.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></strong><strong> </strong>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>Paraphrase đề <em>Population Aged 65+ in Three Countries: 1980&ndash;2030</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số từ 65 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n - 3 quốc gia - từ 1980 đến 2000 - dự đo&aacute;n v&agrave;o năm 2030.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IGyjdCCmNoNsJMxOIIblTD7wgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>cả 3 quốc gia đều c&oacute; xu hướng tăng v&agrave; xu hướng được dự b&aacute;o tiếp tục đến 2030.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhBGdssNdoh7nBxbXBElrx25g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Germany lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; tỷ lệ d&acirc;n số từ 65 tuổi trở l&ecirc;n cao nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZrvgdhtrQovJnNxqKVSl5FLhgxe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SX0BduN3Colr0qxzGQjl2lytg0e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Germany</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0kDdgTi5oHVmsx4oORlw6WqgNg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EiD8dql9ro01MYxPKeVlJN8Vgbb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1980 </strong><em>(</em><em>bắt đầu</em><em> với 15%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JfuUdU4NhoAimmxEXZdlUF8jgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng từ 1980 đến 2000 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> đến 20% v&agrave;o năm 2000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3N4doObJoXF9zxr9KYlNxUcg8d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng dự đo&aacute;n đến 2030</strong> <em>(</em><em>tiếp tục tăng</em><em>&nbsp;v&agrave; đạt 25% v&agrave;o 2030)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SCSwdax9tomUUSxefRElcRiTgHc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>Canada v&agrave; UK</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSyKdPquDoHNLsx437klvBhngvV\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 </span>như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HvXBdcVfjoCDClx58gFlV7zAg6d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1980 </strong><em>(Canada ghi nhận tỷ lệ thấp nhất với 10%, trong khi UK </em><em>cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể</em><em> với 14%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GBhjdRFJmosMiLxKK0Ml1DHggkf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Canada </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>tăng đều</strong></em><em> đến 15% v&agrave;o năm 2000, v&agrave; dự kiến </em><em><strong>tăng đ&aacute;ng kể</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 22% v&agrave;o năm 2030)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHCBdb8hCoS0FCxsOuClQseMguP\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của UK</strong> <em>(tăng</em><em><strong> </strong></em><em>l&ecirc;n 15% v&agrave;o năm 2020 v&agrave; dự kiến đạt 19% v&agrave;o 2030)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKR6dLMaeoXxeTxrXRSlEEvNg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJajd9MRxov4Xlx4cYnlBUNYgYc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, để chỉ h&agrave;nh động <strong>dự b&aacute;o </strong>m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng <strong>\"expect\",</strong> <strong>\"forecast\"</strong> hay \"<strong>project</strong>\" để c&acirc;u văn đa dạng hơn nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IC0sdiTmLoBw6nxKGHPlHNkGgch\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YF6CdGxQaoAlqzxaVrDlWoqfg3g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Overall, all three nations experienced rising proportions of elderly population between 1980 and 2000, and this trend is <strong>expected</strong> to continue until 2030.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RPs2dat99oH76pxp5golHUnyg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Additionally, Germany recorded the highest percentage throughout the first 20-year period and is <strong>forecast</strong> to remain in this leading position by 2030.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TmZtddG1Ho79vaxwr5qleiYGg3c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Canadian elderly population then increased steadily to 15% in 2000 and is <strong>projected</strong> to rise significantly to 22% by 2030.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 383,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RVrxdiICbo0fdFxGlDTlVdFzgFg\">The bar chart compares the percentages of elderly population aged 65 and above in three countries, namely Canada, Germany and the UK, in 1980 and 2000, along with projections for 2030.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 384,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LwuCdKA2doa1jrxVSx4l2ovcgof\">Overall, all three nations experienced rising proportions of elderly population between 1980 and 2000, and this trend is expected to continue until 2030. Additionally, Germany recorded the highest percentage throughout the first 20-year period and is forecast to remain in this leading position by 2030.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 385,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PvpIdGdWUohU9NxhDqklFvtigyc\">Looking at Germany's figures in detail, this country started with 15% of its population being 65 and older in 1980. The proportion then rose substantially to 20% by 2000, and this upward trend is forecast to continue, reaching 25% by 2030, marking the highest level among the three countries.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 386,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Fe62dO01bozayVxSnBSlbUjlgFc\">As for the remaining countries, in 1980, Canada recorded the lowest percentage at 10%, while the UK's figure was notably higher at 14%. The Canadian elderly population then increased steadily to 15% in 2000 and is projected to rise significantly to 22% by 2030. Similarly, the UK saw its proportion grow to 15% in 2000, though its expected increase is more modest, reaching only 19% by the end of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13783,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
